<p>The React implementation additionally supports an experimental <code>@autoAlign</code>
prop that repositions the popover with <code>floating-ui</code> to stay within the
viewport. That behavior is preview-only upstream and is not implemented
here; use <code>@align</code> to pick a static position instead.</p>
